WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.850
A class marks the elements you choose, and a dot rule styles only those

2
00:00:05.676 --> 00:00:09.526
class="note" gives this paragraph a name of your choice.

3
00:00:10.504 --> 00:00:15.029
In the style block, a dot and the name pick everything marked with that class.

4
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.305
Only the marked paragraph changes.

5
00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:21.906
Any number of elements can share one class.
